WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.615 --> 00:00:15.595
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Ben! Are you OK?

2
00:00:16.546 --> 00:00:21.903
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah, I&#x2019;m OK. I&#x2019;m just really worried about Emma.

3
00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:34.728
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Listen, your Aunt Jenny sent a message. She says your sister&#x2019;s OK. She&#x2019;s in hospital, but she&#x2019;s OK.

4
00:00:35.070 --> 00:00:40.077
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> She&#x2019;s OK&#x2026;She&#x2019;s OK.

5
00:00:42.755 --> 00:00:44.057
What a relief!

6
00:00:44.687 --> 00:00:47.828
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Yeah. She&#x2019;s OK.

7
00:00:52.501 --> 00:00:58.196
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Thanks&#x2026;thanks for coming.

8
00:00:59.927 --> 00:01:02.330
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Of course I came.

9
00:01:05.585 --> 00:01:09.064
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Oh, uh&#x2026;How did the interview go?

10
00:01:09.815 --> 00:01:15.047
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> It went very well. I was amazing!

11
00:01:16.123 --> 00:01:22.606
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Of course you were. I knew it. When are they going to tell you if you got the job?

12
00:01:23.433 --> 00:01:25.435
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> They&#x2019;re going to call me tomorrow.

13
00:01:28.489 --> 00:01:30.241
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I&#x2019;m sure you&#x2019;re going to get it!

14
00:01:32.069 --> 00:01:33.521
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> I hope so.

15
00:01:35.373 --> 00:01:40.304
<v><b>Announcement:</b></v> The next train to Gatwick Airport leaves from platform thirteen.

16
00:01:43.308 --> 00:01:44.860
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> That&#x2019;s me.

17
00:01:48.189 --> 00:01:50.267
See you, Izzy.

18
00:01:51.869 --> 00:01:53.847
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> When are you going to come back?

19
00:01:58.252 --> 00:01:59.504
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I don&#x2019;t know.

20
00:02:00.831 --> 00:02:05.236
In a week or two&#x2026;It depends&#x2026;

21
00:02:06.113 --> 00:02:08.090
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> See you when you get back.

22
00:02:08.415 --> 00:02:12.571
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Yeah. Uh,&#x2026;here?

23
00:02:13.109 --> 00:02:18.954
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Right here&#x2026;well, if I&#x2019;m not working in my cool new job.

24
00:02:19.104 --> 00:02:20.969
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> Of course.

25
00:02:21.607 --> 00:02:29.317
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Or if I&#x2019;m just too busy to see you. Or if it&#x2019;s raining!

26
00:02:29.305 --> 00:02:31.545
<v><b>Ben:</b></v> I&#x2019;m going to miss you, Izzy.

27
00:02:59.118 --> 00:02:59.644
Bye.

28
00:03:00.332 --> 00:03:01.046
<v><b>Izzy:</b></v> Bye.